en--idha-first-study-pannu","content":"Indha rendu, munnadi phases-la irundhu enna use pannirukku-nu kavanikanum: type hints\n(Phase 3 & 7), oru \"record\"-a dict (Phase 2), mattrum `for` + `if` vechi list-a manual-a\nsearch pannradhu (Phase 1 & 2).","locale":"tanglish"},"1030":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice-11","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice#nee-turn","content":"Indha aidhaiyum nee eluthu. Keela irukura ovvondrum oru spec — signature mattrum adhu\nexact-a enna pannanum-nu — code illa. Bottom-la irukura solution-a paakradhukku munnadi\nbody-a eluthu.","locale":"tanglish"},"1031":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice-12","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice#nee-turn","content":"**1. Get all users**","locale":"tanglish"},"1032":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice-13","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice#nee-turn","content":"Store-la irukura ovvoru user-um return pannu.","locale":"tanglish"},"1033":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice-14","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice#nee-turn","content":"**2. Update user**","locale":"tanglish"},"1034":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice-15","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice#nee-turn","content":"`user_id` vechi user-a find pannu. `name` mattrum/allathu `email`, new value actual-a pass\npannirundhale matum update pannu — argument `None`-nu irundha andha field-a touch panna\nvendam. Update panniya user-a return pannu, andha id-la user illana `None` return pannu.","locale":"tanglish"},"1035":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice-16","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/final-practice#nee-turn","content":"**3. Delete user**","locale":"tanglish"