/phase-4/inheritance#inheritance","content":"`Dog`, `Animal`-la irundhu ellathayum inherit pannikkum — `__init__`-um sagitham — `speak()`\nmatum override pannum.","locale":"tanglish"},"1444":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance-7","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance#super","content":"Child class-ku thani `__init__` venum, aana parent oda setup logic-um run aaganum-nu bothu,\n`super()` call pannu — TypeScript-oda constructor-kulla `super(...)` panra same idea than.","locale":"tanglish"},"1445":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance-8","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance#super","content":"TypeScript:","locale":"tanglish"},"1446":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance-9","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance#super","content":"Python:","locale":"tanglish"},"1447":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance-10","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/inheritance#super","content":"Difference: TypeScript direct-a `super(name)` call pannum; Python first `super()` call\npannum (arguments edhuvum illama) parent-oda reference edukkum, apparam adhoda mela\n`.__init__(name)` call pannum. Result same than — `Dog` edhavadhu add pannradhukku munnadi\nparent oda constructor run aagi `self.name`-a set pannidum.","locale":"tanglish"},"1448":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self","type":"page","content":"__init__ & self","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Python Notes","Phase 4 — Python OOP"],"tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self","locale":"tanglish"},"1449":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self-0","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self","content":"Pyt