parameter-a explicit-a eluthanum** — JS/TS\nmaadhiri `this`-a Python automatic-a invisible-a add pannadhu.","locale":"tanglish"},"1457":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self-8","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/init-and-self#instance-variables","content":"`self.name` mattrum `self.age` **instance variables** — andha specific object-ku matum\nsonthamana data, TS class-la `this.name` maadhiri exact-a. Nee create pannura ovvoru\nobject-um adhoda own copy-a vechikkum:","locale":"tanglish"},"1458":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","type":"page","content":"Methods","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Python Notes","Phase 4 — Python OOP"],"tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","locale":"tanglish"},"1459":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods-0","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","content":"Class-kulla irukura functions — mattrum self yen innum varudhu","locale":"tanglish"},"1460":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods-1","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods#self-innum-varudhu","content":"self innum varudhu","locale":"tanglish"},"1461":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods-2","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","content":"**Method** na class-kulla define pannina oru function than. `__init__`-um technically oru\nmethod than — create aagum bothu run aagura oru special method matum than.","locale":"tanglish"},"1462":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods-3","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","content":"TypeScript:","locale":"tanglish"},"1463":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods-4","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","content":"Python:","locale":"tanglish"},"1464":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods-5","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods#self-innum-varudhu","content":"Ovvoru method-um `self`-a adhoda first parameter-a venum, object oda instance variables\n(indha `self.name`) read pannradhukku. Idhu munnadi page-la paartha same `self` than —\nPython matum idha ovvoru method signature-layum explicit-a name pannanum-nu solum.","locale":"tanglish"},"1465":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods-6","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-4/methods#self-innum-varudhu","content":"**Aana method-a call pannum bothu, `self`-a nee pass panna vendam** — `user.greet()`,\n`user.greet(user)` illa. Dot-ku munnadi irukura object-a vechi Python `self`-a automatic-a\nfill pannikkum; nee **remaining** parameters-a matum than pass pannanum.","locale":"tanglish"},"1466":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension","type":"page","content":"Dictionary Comprehension","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Python Notes","Phase 5 — Python-specific Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension","locale":"tanglish"},"1467":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension-0","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension","content":"List comprehension oda same idea than, aana dict build pannum","locale":"tanglish"},"1468":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension-1","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-5/dictionary-comprehension","content":"List comprehension panra same idea than, aana idhu oru `dict`-a build pannum — oru single\nexpression-ku badhila ovvoru side-layum `key: value` pair irukum.","locale":"tanglish"},