-ku-badhila-built-in-exception-types","content":"Oru generic Error ku badhila built-in exception types","locale":"tanglish"},"1534":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise-2","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise#nee-raise-pannadha-catch-pannradhu","content":"Nee raise pannadha catch pannradhu","locale":"tanglish"},"1535":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise-3","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","content":"`raise` na Python oda `throw` — idhu current code-a stop pannitu, close-la irukura matching\n`except`-ku control-a kudukkum.","locale":"tanglish"},"1536":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise-4","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","content":"JavaScript:","locale":"tanglish"},"1537":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise-5","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","content":"Python:","locale":"tanglish"},"1538":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise-6","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise#oru-generic-error-ku-badhila-built-in-exception-types","content":"JS mostly oru `Error` class than kudukkum, adhoda message allathu oru custom subclass vechi\nnee errors-a distinguish pannuva. Python-la, common situations ku several **built-in\nexception types** irukku, nee match aagura onnu pick pannikanum:","locale":"tanglish"},"1539":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise-7","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise#oru-generic-error-ku-badhila-built-in-exception-types","content":"Idhu than munnadi page specific exception types-a catch pannu-nu solradhukku exact reason —\n`raise` mattrum `except` rendu side-layum same names than.","locale":"tanglish"},"1540":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise-8","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/raise#nee-raise-pannadha-catch-pannradhu","content":"JS-um same pattern than:","locale":"tanglish"},"1541":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","type":"page","content":"try / except","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Python Notes","Phase 6 — Exceptions + Modules"],"tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","locale":"tanglish"},"1542":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-0","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","content":"Python oda try/catch — aana specific error-a name pannanum-nu solum","locale":"tanglish"},"1543":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-1","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#basic-shape","content":"Basic shape","locale":"tanglish"},"1544":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-2","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#everything-a-illa-specific-errors-a-matum-catch-pannu","content":"Everything-a illa, specific errors-a matum catch pannu","locale":"tanglish"},"1545":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-3","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#finally","content":"finally","locale":"tanglish"},"1546":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-4","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#basic-shape","content":"JavaScript:","locale":"tanglish"},"1547":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-5","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#basic-shape","content":"Python:","locale":"tanglish"},"1548":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-6","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#basic-shape","content":"`except` na Python oda `catch`. Baaki ellam same than padikkalam: fail aaga vaaippu irukura\ncode first block-la, recovery logic second block-la irukum.","locale":"tanglish"},"1549":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-7","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#basic-shape","content":"**JS-la irundhu varra oru gotcha:** JavaScript-la `10 / 0` throw pannadhu — quietly\n`Infinity` kudukkum. Python-la, zero-la divide pannina **exception raise aagum**. Different\nlanguages-ku, error-nu enna count aagum-nu different rules.","locale":"tanglish"},"1550":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-8","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#everything-a-illa-specific-errors-a-matum-catch-pannu","content":"JS oda `catch (error)`, edhuvum question kekama catch pannidum. Python, mele example-la\nirukura `ZeroDivisionError` maadhiri, nee expect pannura **specific exception type**-a name\npanna encourage pannum. Nee frequent-a paakura built-in ones:","locale":"tanglish"},"1551":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-9","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#everything-a-illa-specific-errors-a-matum-catch-pannu","content":"`except Exception` vechi broad-a-um catch pannalaam, `str(e)` vechi message-a read\npannalaam — JS-la `error.message` read panradhu maadhiri than:","locale":"tanglish"},"1552":{"id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except-10","page_id":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tanglish/docs/phase-6/try-except#everything-a-illa-specific-errors-a-matum-catch-pannu","content":"Enna guard pannuroam-nu theriyum bothu, specific exception-a name pannradha prefer pannu —\nidhu than idiomatic Python style, adhoda mela, unrelated bug-a accidental-a swallow